==French==

===Etymology===
Informal. From {{m|fr|de||of, from}} and {{m|fr|rien||nothing}}. Literally meaning "of nothing".

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/də ʁjɛ̃/|lang=fr}}
* {{audio|Fr-de rien-fr-Paris.ogg|audio (Paris)|lang=fr}}

===Interjection===
{{fr-intj|sg={{l/fr|de}} {{l/fr|rien}}}}

# {{label|fr|after being thanked}} [[you're welcome|You're welcome]].
# [[it's nothing|It's nothing]].

====Synonyms====
* {{l|fr|pas de quoi}}
* {{label|fr|Switzerland}} [[service]]

===Anagrams===
* {{l|fr|denier}}, {{l|fr|dénier}}

